<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>uzk50gi</Major>
    <Description>this macro removes pretty mutch all of the uzk50gi recoil
in game settings:
fov 84
1920x1080
sens 6
dpi 800
1x 40

uzk50gi attachment:
compensator
holo
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 2 ms
MoveR 0 3
Delay 4 ms
MoveR 0 3
Delay 3 ms
